inganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1343630/a4fc9693-50f7-4139-8bdf-d01adde60843.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"We offer our house furnished for rent for a period of two months. We ourselves go abroad for this time. The house is a terrace-end house with garden and is located in the south of Kiel in the district of Kronsburg, near Meimersdorf. In front of the door is a parking space with wallbox available. The bus stop can be reached in 2 minutes on foot. By bus or by bike it takes 10-15 minutes to the main train station / city center. \n\nSo you are well connected here, but on the other hand it is also very quiet.\n\nWithin walking distance are doctors (family doctor / dentist), primary schools, kindergartens, supermarkets, pharmacy, bakery, beauty salon, hairdresser, optician, snack bar, savings bank...\n\nThe house has three floors. On the ground floor there is a guest toilet, a pantry, the kitchen and the living / dining area as well as the covered terrace, which is in the sun in the morning. The kitchen is fully equipped and has all the necessary tools (stove / oven / sink / dishwasher / coffee machine / Thermomix / toaster / kettle / fridge / freezer / SodaStream).   \n\nOn the first floor there are two bedrooms and a room with a shelf wall and a large wardrobe as well as the bathroom with washing machine and shower-toilet, 2 sinks, shower and bath.\n\nOn the second floor is another bedroom and a very spacious study with access to a spacious balcony with west orientation. So here you have the sun in the afternoon / evening. \n\nThe garden has a sandpit, a slide, a nest swing and a trampoline. In the garden hut and in the bicycle shed you will find more toys and bicycles (if desired). Outdoors, there is a clothes dryer to dry laundry.\n","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"3"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"private"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"gas"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"discussable"},"playMusic":{"value":"yes"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"no"},"tenantStatus":{"value":"working professionals only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"157"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":200000,"deposit":300000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"2000.00","deposit":"3000.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":2,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":25,"maxAge":50,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-07-09"}],"updated":"2026-07-09T13:07:27Z","__utId__":"ut1343630"}]